<title>USA: U.S. stock index futures end mostly lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. stock index futures end mostly lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 6 - U.S. stock index futures finished mostly lower after a session dominated by profit-taking and tech sector weakness. Traders noted late local short-covering in June S&amp;P 500 futures. Trade overall brisk on the day, action choppy after run to record highs on Monday.</p>
